OL,3,GNEWSAWalking and cycling routes due for
OL,4,Asafety upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal planners say they are hoping to
OL,7,Fmake walking, wheeling and cycling
OL,8,Fsafer and easier across a town.
OL,10,FWest Northamptonshire Council has
OL,11,Fstarted a consultation on a series of
OL,12,Fproposed active travel improvements
OL,13,Facross Brackley.
OL,15,FIt hopes to support safer journeys to
OL,16,Fschool, improve accessibility for
OL,17,Fpeople walking, wheeling and cycling,
OL,18,Fencourage healthier sustainable travel
OL,19,Fchoices and enhance connections across
OL,20,Fthe town centre.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
